msgid ""
"Suggested: a multilingual embedding model (French and English), small "
"(0.3–0.6B) and fast, e.g. bge-m3, qwen3-embedding:0.6b, embeddinggemma; "
"nomic-embed-text is mostly English."
msgstr ""
"Suggéré : un modèle d'embeddings multilingue (français et anglais), petit"
" (0,3 à 0,6 B) et rapide, p. ex. bge-m3, qwen3-embedding:0.6b, "
"embeddinggemma ; nomic-embed-text est surtout anglais."

msgid ""
"Suggested: a small instruction model (4–8B) is enough to copy facts from "
"a text into JSON, and much faster: e.g. qwen3:8b (without thinking), "
"gemma3:4b; 12–14B if it misses lines or mixes people (e.g. gemma3:12b, "
"qwen3:14b)."
msgstr ""
"Suggéré : un petit modèle d'instruction (4 à 8 B) suffit pour recopier "
"des faits d'un texte en JSON, et il est bien plus rapide : p. ex. "
"qwen3:8b (sans réflexion), gemma3:4b ; 12 à 14 B s'il oublie des lignes "
"ou mélange des personnes (p. ex. gemma3:12b, qwen3:14b)."

msgid ""
"Suggested: a small instruction model (4–8B) is enough to copy the parts "
"of the references into JSON, e.g. qwen3:8b (without thinking), gemma3:4b;"
" 12–14B if it merges or splits references (e.g. gemma3:12b, qwen3:14b)."
